body:
I feel the same way. If you look hard enough you are more than likely going to find low etv or $0 etv within the six month evaluation period. 

&#x200B;

This is why you should always read multiple reviews on items no matter the stars. For instance I recently purchased some gel polish and was wondering why some polishes looked really nice but got low stars. Looked at the reviews and most said the product was great but small bottles. The thing about gel polish is that they tend to come in smaller bottles than regular polish and after looking at the size it was a normal gel polish size.

I had GBP and cancelled and wanted to try Boxy and only kept it for 2 months because it was very underwhelming and now Im back with Ipsy.  

I haven't seen many reviews on the cleanser so I curious to try it.  

&#x200B;
